0\u00b0 Live-Streams in 3D - als w\u00e4rst du selbst da \nW\u00e4hle deinen Kamerawinkel jederzeit \n\nRiesige Events in Echtzeit: Bundesliga, Supercup, Festivals u.v.m. \nSprach- und Handsteuerung f\u00fcr maximale Immersion \n  \nBE THERE NOW. ", "short_description": "Sport & Konzerte in 360\u00b0 \u2013 be there now "}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "CoverImageSquare.png", "id": "1656216171741820", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819775_1656216175075153_2895559536759162680_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vWIXbbOo79UQ7kNvwEmNT_7&_nc_oc=AdrpTH1OymHDJrHZopoJZBrpVA8i4eJYKwpwxuOavbvYU0sbhbluVFC-3sbR4sGRwYk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKfF_uhWJJ2QKWhAZkLOWyUKVwX58T3Y4sdKS4ylSd3qA&oe=6AAD6316"}, {"file_name": "CoverImagePortrait.png", "id": "1414326893195674", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821107_1414326896529007_8462027792716524313_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4ttPubV0syEQ7kNvwGU5_ZO&_nc_oc=AdqtmA7-N5O0NME-WrBVd5e8nonb9ABIqO2CDn5f5-GA98uGGlISLAg-x29RP60N9yg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIMaKf0nzj8x_qoatzLAaRwSPGYgFtoNR_VPGwZDJpdoQ&oe=6AAD34AD"}, {"file_name": "L1VE_LOGO.png", "id": "1141925937781157", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822789_1141925944447823_7424494728140263932_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_k_5lf36XbQQ7kNvwHI4Fr4&_nc_oc=AdqZNdj-sEuL_J3zjuDwk7CvKALHn2psaMLJLdEMXEW-M0P3GpfVEI7P4zkQQYFqlJE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKVQv3_blJzzwm_kpCBZbecSlNfxMMaNO4NNOPuDxYjvw&oe=6AAD2CED"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "996045819187461", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820325_996045822520794_3628469034101667116_n.png?_nc_ca